d-solution "The third equation states that $z=1.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\ny-(1)=2\\,⟹\\,y=2+1=3.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $z=1$ and $y=3$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\nx-(3)-(1)=3\\,⟹\\,x=3+4=7.\n$$\n\nThus, the solution is $x=7$,  $y=3$,  and $z=1.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as $⟨7,3,1⟩.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265729 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c11278a-a1e9-521c-8e8b-63cb64cbc9b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨4,\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263657} {:answer/id #uuid "53dcbf06-1cbe-5c03-8acd-dfd116927d2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨2,\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263724} {:answer/id #uuid "67ee26c7-aa79-54e7-bb6c-da2cbb6aa207" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨2,-\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263896} {:answer/id #uuid "b3ccb4f9-e91b-5c5f-8631-fab1ffd18bc1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨4,-\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264544} {:answer/id #uuid "f84f6f46-07f3-5a35-aae2-92b02c84f290" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨0,-\\frac{3}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265173}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c11278a-a1e9-521c-8e8b-63cb64cbc9b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨4,\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263657} :answer-field/id #uuid "62d7fc5b-0d95-51be-9907-cd6c773cab26" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265417}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b7e933dd-83fd-54e7-932e-d388f7f7060c" :question/math-academy-id "q-129447" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The third equation states that ${x}_{3}=-1.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+(-1)=-\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}+1=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$ and ${x}_{3}=-1$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+(-1)=2\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=2+1+1=4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is ${x}_{1}=4$, ${x}_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$, and ${x}_{3}=-1.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as $⟨4,\\frac{1}{2},-1⟩.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265730 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12383fa6-1be7-5faa-98b0-50c492b27020" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{15}{2} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263173} {:answer/id #uuid "1482ccf9-247e-547f-978e-1785125b302f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263191} {:answer/id #uuid "36c944a4-efa5-527c-b4b4-15c498f39d84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263486} {:answer/id #uuid "5e9ae90d-a61d-502f-a079-6171d561d548" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263818} {:answer/id #uuid "e5272ebd-57ab-5c9a-943c-aa4636f76330" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{15}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264993}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "36c944a4-efa5-527c-b4b4-15c498f39d84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263486} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f470e8a-d3f0-56a1-9405-dc8785df05d9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265468}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ffbc1914-8f55-58fc-9939-7cf601faf78b" :question/math-academy-id "q-129452" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y-z &=2 \\\\ y-z &=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ z &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The third equation states that $z=3.$ Substituting this into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\ny-3=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,y=\\frac{1}{2}+3=\\frac{7}{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $y=\\frac{7}{2}$ and $z=3$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\nx+\\frac{7}{2}-3=2\\,⟹\\,x=2-\\frac{7}{2}+3=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=\\frac{3}{2}$, $y=\\frac{7}{2}$, and $z=3.$ In vector form, the solution can be written as\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265731 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a172890-3f87-5a80-964d-e89a1fb78934" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨0,-4,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263777} {:answer/id #uuid "d768f9e7-ff33-529d-9697-e0257e01235f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨6,-4,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264879} {:answer/id #uuid "e4666737-b082-581c-a226-b9480b7e82c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨6,4,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264985} {:answer/id #uuid "eac5eddd-1434-5977-8e97-e4df1980cf72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨6,0,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265045} {:answer/id #uuid "ffdbfc12-7648-502a-bc1c-5a7448cf96b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨2,0,-2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265251}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4666737-b082-581c-a226-b9480b7e82c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨6,4,